<%# Opening a duel: what it is, what it is about, then the button.

    A white card rather than the indigo band it used to be. The band was the
    loudest thing on the page and held a white button, so the one thing to do
    here was drawn in a different language from every other primary in the
    app; now it is the ordinary tactile key.

    The categories are chips rather than a multi-select, because the whole list
    has to be readable at a glance by a child deciding between „каквото и да е"
    and „дроби". They are out in the open rather than folded away — five or six
    chips are one row on a tablet, and a picker behind a disclosure was a
    picker nobody found. Picking none is still the default and means anything,
    so the fast path is still one press.

    Only the categories this student has problems in are listed. See
    DuelCategories: the bank is not square, and offering „Тригонометрия" to a
    nine-year-old buys them a match against the question bank rather than
    against another child.

    locals: categories, current (the match this student is already in, if any) %>
<section class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-ink-150 sm:p-6">
  <div>
    <h2 class="text-[22px] font-black leading-tight tracking-[-.01em]"><%= t("duel.title") %></h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      <%= t("duel.sub", count: Challenge::QUESTION_COUNT, seconds: Challenge::SECONDS_PER_QUESTION,
            correct: ChallengeScoring::CORRECT_POINTS, speed: ChallengeScoring::SPEED_POINTS) %>
    </p>
  </div>

  <% if current %>
    <%= link_to t("challenges.rejoin"), challenge_path(current, close_path: challenges_path),
                class: "button button-primary button-large" %>
  <% else %>
    <%= form_with url: challenges_path, method: :post, class: "flex flex-col gap-4" do %>
      <% if categories.any? %>
        <fieldset>
          <legend class="text-[14px] font-extrabold text-ink-600">
            <%= t("duel.pick_categories") %> · <span class="font-bold text-ink-500"><%= t("duel.pick_categories_hint") %></span>
          </legend>
          <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <% categories.each do |category| %>
              <label class="format-chip">
                <%= check_box_tag "topic_ids[]", category.id, false, id: "category-#{category.id}", class: "sr-only" %>
                <span><%= category.name %></span>
              </label>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      <% end %>

      <%= submit_tag t("challenges.find_opponent"), class: "button button-primary button-large" %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</section>
